Visually distinguished by its bold orange and dark grey hazardous-materials color scheme, "Jack" featured hermetically sealed, multi-layered radiation shielding. The armor integrated air-filtration systems and thermal dampeners capable of completely isolating the pilot from lethal environmental toxins, extreme radiation spikes, and biohazard threats.

In Iron Man 3, Mark XXVIII deploys alongside the Iron Legion during the House Party Protocol at the Norco oil rig, engaging Extremis forces before being destroyed in the final "Clean Slate" detonation order.
